<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:30:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>感恩节风暴导致东海岸 50 万人断电</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-weather-east-coast-storm.html</link><description>这场风暴给弗吉尼亚州和纽约带来了大雨和强风，扰乱了假期期间的旅行。预计周五情况将逐渐改善。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-weather-east-coast-storm.html'&gt;感恩节风暴导致东海岸 50 万人断电&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Thanksgiving Storm Leaves Half a Million Without Power on the East Coast&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/us/thanksgiving-weather-east-coast-storm.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 12:48:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>纽约人和游客试图挽救因大雨而推迟的游行日</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html</link><description>风和雨使通常在感恩节天空中占据主导地位的受人喜爱的气球停飞，周四游行路线沿线的街道大多空无一人。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html'&gt;纽约人和游客试图挽救因大雨而推迟的游行日&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：New Yorkers and Tourists Try to Salvage a Parade Day Postponed by Rain&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-empty-streets.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 20:53:41 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>照片：梅西百货感恩节游行历史和古怪时刻</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-parade-history-timeline.html</link><description>让纽约市的感恩节游行保持正常进行并不总是那么容易。以下是对重要时刻和不幸事件的回顾。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-parade-history-timeline.html'&gt;照片：梅西百货感恩节游行历史和古怪时刻&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Photos: Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade History and Wacky Moments&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-parade-history-timeline.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 13:02:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期优惠很诱人。以下是如何避免买家后悔的方法。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/holiday-shopping-deals-spending.html</link><description>有些交易好得令人难以置信。专家建议进行计算，列出清单并避免使用“立即购买，稍后付款”的平台进行购买。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/holiday-shopping-deals-spending.html'&gt;假期优惠很诱人。以下是如何避免买家后悔的方法。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Holiday Deals Are Tempting. Here’s How to Avoid Buyer’s Remorse.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/holiday-shopping-deals-spending.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:03:51 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>随着价格上涨，美国人正在做出权衡而不是削减开支</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/inflation-consumer-spending-trade-offs-holidays.html</link><description>在强劲的消费支出中，许多家庭决定将钱花在他们最看重的膳食、旅行和活动上。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/inflation-consumer-spending-trade-offs-holidays.html'&gt;随着价格上涨，美国人正在做出权衡而不是削减开支&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：As Prices Rise, Americans Are Making Trade-Offs Rather Than Cutting Back&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/27/business/inflation-consumer-spending-trade-offs-holidays.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 10:02:41 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>